# counter harness. pyKMC partn_search from the reactant, highest free atoms first.
# The call total is the reactant minimization, the searches, and the two endpoint minimizations.
# A success is one index-1 saddle under the cap, force at the stop, barrier in (0, 1.5) eV,
# and exactly one endpoint within Cartesian RMSD 0.5 of the minimized reactant
# on the protruding atoms (within 1.5 A of the highest free atom).
# The 2014 rate and barrier columns are a different observable.
